    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:08d808be65fcee718ed0cb3f",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "但是为什么是『白拍子』呢？　这讲的是修炼艺术的故事吧。\n有点想不明白，在『骏大祭』演这种奉纳剧有什么意义呢？",
      "source_fingerprint": "0bd90a9f354875ce3b32ae01c97555420a72340bcd2aab2eaf132fc4e856796c",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/09/0030/storytimeline_090030002.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        51,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/51/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:64bd4dd25cc89b09a626b56c",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "圣王光环",
      "source_fingerprint": "ae4906d6dcdeefba22045311d828cb642edc30b721f0d70bdfe2ab3207e98c48",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
